  <ScenTitle>A Day at Red Flag, 1977</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;The Red Flag exercises introduced in the 1970s brought a new level of realistic training to the American air forces. This early Red Flag features the USAF's fighter squadrons against highly trained Aggressors in a mission to attack a heavily defended target.&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
